	<section_number>30-240</section_number>
	<catch_line>Chesapeake Bay Commission created</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Chesapeake Bay Commission, hereinafter designated as "Commission," is hereby created as a tristate legislative commission.
	</text>
	<history>1980, c. 662, § 62.1-69.5; 2004, c. 1000.</history>
